<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Unholy Grasp</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 120), Necromancer (guild level 120)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast unholy grasp &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast unholy grasp</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A stronger prayer to the dark forces than unholy touch: the caster grasps 
at the target, and those who lean to good are hurt badly. Any target whose 
alignment is above neutral can be struck, and the truly good are hurt more; on the evil and the neutral, 
nothing happens. The better your divine power and your skill in the spell, the 
more it hurts. It does best against clothes and a little less the heavier the 
armour, and a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while 
fighting. It is also found on scrolls. The 
strongest of these prayers is unholy shout.
</p><p><br />
